"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Replace used ComAp controller from EI test room.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Test run with shared load for 1 hour.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">G8935 running normal and no more alarm.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">G8935 is back in service (now auto mode).</span></p><p><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></b></p><p><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></b></p><p><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></b></p><p><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></b></p><p><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History (27/04/2025)</b></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><b>Today''s Activity</b><br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Weekly test run diesel generator G8935</span></p><p><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></b></u></p><p><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Found</b></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">G8935 stop with following alarms during shared load 30 min.</span></p><p><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alarms:</u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">1)BOC L1 under</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2)sd stop fail&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><b><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action</u></b></p><p><b><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">G8935</u></b></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">- Performed test run by manual.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">- Performed test run with shared load 30mins.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">- Checked all parameters during generator running with shared load.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">- All lightings inside cabin are working properly.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-G8935 stop with alarms during shared load 30 min.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Cleared alarm and set auto mode of G8935</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '2025-04-30 18:56:43', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Se-EI', NULL, false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
  INSERT INTO tags (report_id, equipment_no, technical_id_no, technical_object_description, superior_functional_location, superior_equipment, text, location, children, created_date, updated_date) VALUES (new_report_id, 'ATL-OC-G-8935', 'ATL-OC-G-8935', 'Gen, Generator ZOC Diesel Gas Package', NULL, NULL, 'Gen, Generator ZOC Diesel Gas Package', 'OC', false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
