n hook overhaul ball 0.20 mm.</p>   <p>-Inspected and   measured diameter main &amp; auxiliary wire rope for checked any damage. </p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Main   wire rope&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; =24.3 mm,   24.4 mm, 24.5 mm.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   Auxiliary wire rope&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; =16.2 mm, 16.3 mm, 16.4 mm.</p>   <p>- Checked and tighten   for lightning rod and lightning cable in pedestal crane. </p>   <p>- Checked condition   of slip ring. (Good condition)</p>   <p>- Function electrical   system and lighting system, boom flood light 5/6, boom flood light 3/4, boom   flood light 1/2, inside cabin light.</p>   <p>- Function tested   main and auxiliary pressure brake test. (See Record in JTC report)</p>   <p>- Function tested   main hoist up / down alarm and limit switch. (Proper function)</p>   <p>- Function tested   auxiliary hoist up / down alarm and limit switch. (Proper function)</p>   <p>- Function tested   boom up / down, override and limit switch. (Proper function)</p>   <p>- Function tested   slew left / right, limit switch and override. (Proper function) </p>   <p>- Function tested   slew lock. (Proper function)</p>   <p>- Function tested rotation crane smoothly.   (Good condition)</p>   <p>- Function tested   emergency stop at crane cabin and power pack. (Proper function)</p>   <p>- Function tested   horn. (Proper function)</p>   <p><b>CM activities</b></p>   <p>-Replaced engine fan   belt because worn out.</p>   <p>- Function tested   (load indicator) main and auxiliary found reading error.</p>   <p>- Calibrated main   &amp; aux hoist load cell with load 100%.</p>   <p>- Install Robway key   box</p>   <p>- Housekeeping and   cleaned up working area.</p>   </td>  </tr> </tbody></table>', NULL, '2025-05-04 17:13:32', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\DirekT', NULL, false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
