<br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></p><p><u><b>Activity</b></u><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></p><p>Troubleshooting equalization pump motor P-9135A&amp;B auto function is not working at ZMS Sewage System on 5th May 2025.(Day 1)</p><p><br></p><p><u><b>Action Plan</b></u></p><p>1.Perform function test&nbsp; for both Float Limit Switches are working properly and need to monitor for AUTO Mode function.(Under Monitoring)</p><p><br></p>', NULL, '2025-05-06 17:11:58', '2025-05-08 18:05:38', 'PTTEP\\ZMS.MTN-Tech', 'PTTEP\\ZMS.MTN-Tech', false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
