ested rotation crane 360 for smoothly. (Good condition)</p>  <p>- Function tested horn. (Proper function)</p>  <p>- Lubricated slew ring gear.</p>  <p>- Cut dead end main and auxiliary wire rope each 1 meter.</p>  - Housekeeping and cleaned up working area.', NULL, '2025-05-06 19:48:03', '2025-05-09 19:40:51', 'PTTEP\\DirekT', 'PTTEP\\DirekT', false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
