sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • Crane breaker panel.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • AC distribution panel.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • DC distribution J-box panel.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • Generator box.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • PLC Generator box.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • J-swivel 1.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • J-swivel 2.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • J-swivel 3.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • Platform box.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • Platform ESD box.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;   • ESD panel box</p>   <p>- Function tested run   generator and alternator for measured voltage and current. (See EE report)</p>   <p>- Installed box   robway key.</p>   <p>- Performed crane   pull test.</p>   <p>- Preformed   Calibration auxiliary hoist load indicator (Robway) without load 100%.</p>   <p>- Housekeeping and   cleaned up working area.</p>   </td>  </tr> </tbody></table>', NULL, '2025-05-07 07:27:13', '2025-05-09 19:40:27', 'PTTEP\\DirekT', 'PTTEP\\DirekT', false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
