anel box.</p>  <p>- Function tested run generator and alternator for measured voltage and current. (See EE report)</p>  <p>- Found fuse supply 24 V DC Inside battery disconnect panel box damaged. Plane replace on tomorrow.</p>  - Housekeeping and cleaned up working area', NULL, '2025-05-09 19:46:20', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\DirekT', NULL, false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
