-- Inserting report ID 30816
DO $$
DECLARE
  new_report_id INTEGER;
BEGIN
  INSERT INTO daily_reports (work_order_no, activities_subject, discipline, activities_type, work_status, report_created, task_description, task_remark, created_date, updated_date, created_at, updated_at, is_deleted, asset) VALUES (NULL, 'P-4750B Perform yearly preventive maintenance', 'Mechanic', 'PM', 'In Progress', '2025-05-18', '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 17/05/2025</p><p><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Power-end </b></p><p><b>-&nbsp;</b>Drained lube oil to empty and Opened Crank shaft reservoir      and removed crank shaft bearing for inspection.&nbsp;</p><ul type="disc">  <li>- Changed new bearings crank shaft No.1, No.2 and No.3</li><li><ul type="disc">  <li>- Checked clearance by plastic gauge applied torque the bolts as ( 50 lb-ft / 67 N-M ).</li> </ul>  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; No.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0.76 mm</p>  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; No.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0.051 mm</p>  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; No.3&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.02 mm</p>  &nbsp;&nbsp;<ul type="disc">  <li>- Crank shaft bearing bolts tightened torque values were 50      lb.ft.</li><li>- Replaced oil seal plunger shaft No.1, No.2, No.3.<ul type="disc">  <li><br></li> </ul></li><li><p><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</b><b>&nbsp;Gearbox</b></p><p><b>-&nbsp;</b>Opened top flange and drained lube oil and inspection found gear normal condition</p><p>-&nbsp;Found is oil seal pump drive and motor drive shaft gearbox damage</p><p>- Waiting for incoming s complete set spare parts</p><p><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Coupling</b></p><p>- Removed coupling motor drive shaft and pump drive shaft gear box oil seal cover. (Allen key # 5/16)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;18/05/2025</p><p>- General cleaning and Reassemble parts</p><p>-Top up lube oil at operating level 34 liters.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;19/05/2025</p><p><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Fluid-end</b></p><p><b>- </b>Removed suction and discharge check valve and replaced with new set</p><p>-&nbsp;Replaced new O-ring in front and behind of check valve by the new one</p><ul type="disc">  <li>&nbsp;-Replaced oil seal plunger shaft No.1, No.2, No.3.</li> </ul><p>-&nbsp;Removed stuffing box and inspected all of part were still in      normal condition.</p><ul type="disc">  <li>- Replaced new packing 3 set</li>  <li>- Reinstalled 3 completed set of stuffing box and replaced new      O-ring in of stuffing box.</li>  <li>- Suction check valve stud bolts tightened with torque values      were 375&nbsp; lb.ft</li>  <li>- Discharge check valve stud bolts tightened with torque      values were 175 lb. Ft</li>  <li>- Stuffing box bolts tightened with torque values were 125      lb.ft.</li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 20/05/2025</li><li><br></li><li>- Removed coupling motor drive shaft and pump drive shaft gear box oil seal cover. (Allen key # 5/16)</li><li><ul type="disc">  <li>- Replaced oil seal cover motor drive shaft and pump drive shaft      gearbox.</li>  <li>- Installed oil seal cover coupling motor drive shaft and pump      drive shaft gearbox. </li>  <li>- Cleaned inside gearbox and top up gear oil with PTT EP-320.</li><li>- Check alignment pump to gear box&nbsp;</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><p></p><ul type="disc"></ul><p></p><p></p><ul type="disc"></ul><p></p><p></p><ul type="disc"></ul><p></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 21-05-2025</p><p>- Check alignment gear to motor.</p><p>-·Lubricated coupling by grease MULITS EP 2 and installed both covers.</p><p>- Clean Stainer and clean all skid</p><p>- Waiting test run</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b>Spare Prat</b></p><ul type="disc"><li><ul type="disc"><li><ul type="disc"><li><ul type="disc"> </ul></li><li><p>- O-RING, SUC, P/N.GH95086690&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MESC: 28.40.01.047.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Ea.</p>  <p>- O-RING, ST.BOX,P/N.GH95028452&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MESC: 28.40.01.048.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Ea.</p>  <p>- O-RING, VALVE, DIS, P/N.95028494 or GH95028494&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC: 28.40.01.049.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 6 Ea.</p>  <p>- PACKING DURAMID, N130, P/N.GH83009704&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MESC: 28.40.01.050.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9 Ea.</p>  <p>- OIL, TOTAL AZOLLA ZS 150 (200L--208L/DR)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC: 87.28.95.260.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 36 Liters.</p>  <p>- OIL, PTT GEAR OIL EP 320 (200L/DR)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MESC: 87.25.95.044.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 10 Liters.</p>  <p>- OIL, SEAL, PART # 276A225 Dia, A 001&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC:&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Ea.</p>  <p>- OIL, SEAL, PART # 107879&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC:&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Set.</p>  <p>- OIL SEAL, PART # 107877&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MESC:&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 6 Set. </p>  <p>- Suction check valve new one&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC:&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Set.</p>  <p>- Discharge check valve new one&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC:&nbsp; - &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3 Set.</p>  <p>- GASKET, RTJ, SFIR, OCT, R31D, #900, 3"&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC: 85.37.20.331.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Pc.</p>  <p>- GASKET, SPW, 316L/GRA, IR/CR: 316L, #300, 4"&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC: 85.41.37.580.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Pc.</p>  <p>- GREASE, TOTAL MULTIS EP 2 (24PCS/CARTON)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC: 87.40.94.166.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Tubes.</p>  <p>- ADHESIVE SILICONE RUBBER, RTV 106&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MESC: 88.98.20.205.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Tube.</p>  <p>- Oiler-1 biodegradable&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MESC: 89.14.97.002.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;5 Liters.</p>  <p>- Safety solvent P/N: 8060&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; MESC: 36.56.13.715.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Can.</p>  <p><b>&nbsp;</b></p></li> </ul></li> </ul></li> </ul>', '<div align="right">

