bsp;Discharge pressure=43 bars.</p><p align="left">&nbsp;<b><u>Filters</u></b></p><p align="left">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Remove and clean the filter nozzles.</p><p align="left">o&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 multi-media filters, 2F-4840A/B.</p><p>      </p><p align="left">o&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Carbon filters, 2F-4841A/B.</p><p align="left"><u><b>Unit running and back in service</b></u></p><p align="left">  </p><p align="left">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The unit running condition and all parameters are in normal.</p>', NULL, '2025-05-30 17:10:17', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\GBS.Mechanic-WorkS', NULL, false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
