Span = 79.94 % ( Standard gas = 80.0 %&nbsp; +/- 1 % )</p><p>- Online sample loop and monitoring reading value with CCR , Found there are reading as normal.</p>', NULL, '2025-06-04 17:56:25', '2025-06-04 18:20:37', 'PTTEP\\PongsakR', 'PTTEP\\PongsakR', false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
