fuel tank.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Cleaned and inspected the flame   arrestor of diesel fuel tank. </p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Inspection turbo.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - General inspection ARV.</p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Cleaned unit. </p>   <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Tested running unit (found the tube lube oil cooling turbo seeping)</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <br>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   <p>&nbsp;</p>   </td>  </tr> </tbody></table>', NULL, '2025-06-06 09:05:20', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\Mech_WS', NULL, false, 'G2N') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
