osition Sp2 temp become higher than previous, keep monitoring and plan to order new expansion joint for replace as soon as possible.</p><p>-&nbsp;East side Max temp <b>306.9</b> ’C, at Pictures No.2 position Sp1</p><p><br></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 255);"><b>P</b><b>er</b><b>f</b><b>o</b><b>rm 6 Month </b><b>PM</b><b> Thermoscan </b><b>Ex</b><b>h</b><b>au</b><b>s</b><b>t expansion joint for Feed Gas comp. Turbine WO No.# 500611688 Measurement on </b><b>18</b><b>/07/2</b><b>0</b><b>25</b><b>.</b><b> By Tinnakorn S.</b></span><b>&nbsp;</b><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p><b>A</b><b>-121</b><b>0&nbsp;</b>Max temp <b>422.7</b> ’C, at Picture No.3 position Sp1 exhaust stack above expansion joint.</p><p><b>A</b><b>-221</b><b>0&nbsp;</b>Max temp <b>408.4</b> ’C, at Picture No.3 position Sp1 exhaust stack above expansion joint.</p><p><br></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 255);"><b>P</b><b>er</b><b>f</b><b>o</b><b>rm 6 Month </b><b>PM</b><b> Thermoscan </b><b>Ex</b><b>h</b><b>au</b><b>s</b><b>t expansion joint for Sale Gas Comp. Turbine&nbsp;&nbsp; WO No.# 500611682 Measurement on </b><b>18</b><b>/07/2</b><b>0</b><b>25</b><b>.</b></span><b><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 255);"> By Tinnakorn S</span>.</b></p><p><b>A</b><b>-161</b><b>0&nbsp;</b>Max temp <b>420.8</b> ’C, at Picture No.1 position Sp3 exhaust stack up stream expansion joint.</p><p><b>A</b><b>-261</b><b>0&nbsp;</b>Max temp <b>411.9</b> ’C, at Picture No.2 position Sp3 exhaust stack up stream expansion joint.</p>', NULL, '2025-07-19 15:16:51', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\art.mechcrane', NULL, false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
