7">0–150 bar</strong>.</p><p data-start="518" data-end="568"><br></p> </li> </ul><p>    </p><p data-start="570" data-end="647"><strong data-start="570" data-end="581">Remark:</strong><br data-start="581" data-end="584"> Replaced <strong data-start="593" data-end="612">ABB transmitter</strong> with a <strong data-start="620" data-end="640">Rosemount 3051T4</strong> model.</p>', NULL, '2025-07-25 15:38:45', '2025-07-25 15:41:30', 'PTTEP\\PongsakR', 'PTTEP\\PongsakR', false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
