pt&nbsp;(2)&nbsp;: 2.575 VT&nbsp;/&nbsp;25.00&nbsp;PPM</em></div><div><em><br></em></div><div>**As left reading&nbsp;13.45&nbsp;PPM&nbsp;with&nbsp;standard&nbsp;gas&nbsp;13.00&nbsp;PPM&nbsp;and&nbsp;reading&nbsp;24.65 PPM with standard gas 25.00&nbsp;PPM.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Defective</span> : Found AE-8040 sampling probe may blocked inside./ to be remove and overhaul.</div></div></div></div>', NULL, '2025-08-02 19:35:25', '2025-08-02 19:40:26', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.EI-Workshop', false, 'G2N') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
