 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; pt&nbsp;(2)&nbsp;: 5.690 VT&nbsp;/&nbsp;25.00&nbsp;PPM</em></div><div><em>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; pt&nbsp;(3)&nbsp;: 9.120 VT&nbsp;/ 50.00&nbsp;PPM</em><em></em></div><div><em><br></em></div><div>**As left&nbsp; &nbsp;- reading&nbsp;13.32 PPM&nbsp;with&nbsp;standard&nbsp;gas&nbsp;13.00&nbsp;PPM </div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; - reading&nbsp;24.73 PPM with standard gas 25.00&nbsp;PPM</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;reading 48.20 PPM with standard gas 50.00&nbsp;PPM.</div><div><br></div><div>** Compare analyzer with Dragger tube</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - Process gas , AIT = 37.69 ppm / DG = 20 ppm</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;STD 25 ppm , AIT = 24.73 ppm / DG = 20 ppm</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;STD 50 ppm , AIT = 48.20 ppm / DG = 40 ppm</div></div></div></div>', NULL, '2025-08-03 18:26:14', '2025-08-03 18:28:41', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.EI-Workshop', false, 'G2N') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
