igh at all points in the As Found condition.&nbsp;</div><div>The readings were consistently off by ~0.1 mbar and ~0.011–0.023 mA, which is within a small but potentially unacceptable error range.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>As Left :</div><div>After calibration, the transmitter was restored to perfect linearity and accuracy:</div><div><br></div><div>Applied (mbar)	Reading (mbar)	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;mA Output</div><div>0			0.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;0	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4.00</div><div>155	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;		155.0	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8.00</div><div>310	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;		310.0	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;12.00</div><div>465&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 465.0	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;16.00</div><div>620	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;		620.0	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;20.00</div><div><br></div><div>This shows a successful zero and span adjustment—the transmitter is now fully calibrated and operational.</div>', NULL, '2025-08-04 11:04:04', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\PooritadT', NULL, false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
  INSERT INTO tags (report_id, equipment_no, technical_id_no, technical_object_description, superior_functional_location, superior_equipment, text, location, children, created_date, updated_date) VALUES (new_report_id, 'GBS-2FIT-37624A', 'GBS-2FIT-37624A', 'V-CONE FLOWMETER DUAL TRANSMITTER', NULL, NULL, 'V-CONE FLOWMETER DUAL TRANSMITTER', 'GBS-PP', false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
